WEBVTT

00:12:58.809 --> 00:13:01.691
and will continue to do so indefinitely.

00:13:01.691 --> 00:13:06.264
It is a different kind of language, like art.

00:13:06.264 --> 00:13:09.036
These other vital contributions that extend life

00:13:09.036 --> 00:13:11.729
and relieve suffering are, of course, critical,

00:13:11.729 --> 00:13:13.416
and fantastic,

00:13:13.416 --> 00:13:15.209
but they're part of the continuum of

00:13:15.209 --> 00:13:17.721
our overall knowledge and technology,

00:13:17.721 --> 00:13:20.245
like the Internet.

00:13:20.245 --> 00:13:22.589
So what is next?

00:13:22.589 --> 00:13:24.308
Perhaps counterintuitively,

00:13:24.308 --> 00:13:26.620
I'm guessing it's a visionary idea

00:13:26.620 --> 00:13:28.474
from the late 1930s

00:13:28.474 --> 00:13:31.634
that's been revived every decade since: